{"info":{"author":"Alexander Greenshields Watson","author_email":"Alexander Greenshields Watson <opig@stats.ox.ac.uk>","bugtrack_url":null,"classifiers":[],"description":"# ANARCII\n\nANARCII is a generalised language model for antigen receptor numbering.\n\nFor the user guide please read the [wiki page](https://github.com/oxpig/ANARCII/wiki).\n\n## Installation\n\nFor a full breakdown of all installation options please see: [installation](https://github.com/oxpig/ANARCII/wiki/Installation)\n\n```python\npip install anarcii\n```\n\n## Web tool\n\nWe have a live [web tool](https://opig.stats.ox.ac.uk/webapps/sabdab-sabpred/sabpred/anarcii/):\n\n<https://opig.stats.ox.ac.uk/webapps/sabdab-sabpred/sabpred/anarcii/>\n\nIf you use this code or the web tool in your work, please [cite the paper](#the-paper).\n\n## Citing this work\n\n### The paper\n\n[![DOI](https://zenodo.org/badge/DOI/10.1101/2025.04.16.648720.svg)](https://doi.org/10.1101/2025.04.16.648720)\n\nAll code is based on the following paper:\n\n*ANARCII: A Generalised Language Model for Antigen Receptor Numbering*\n\n<https://www.biorxiv.org/content/10.1101/2025.04.16.648720v1>\n\nPlease cite:\n\n```\nANARCII: A Generalised Language Model for Antigen Receptor Numbering\nAlexander Greenshields-Watson, Parth Agarwal, Sarah A Robinson, Benjamin Heathcote Williams, Gemma L Gordon, Henriette L Capel, Yushi Li, Fabian C Spoendlin, Fergus Boyles, Charlotte M Deane\nbioRxiv 2025.04.16.648720; doi: https://doi.org/10.1101/2025.04.16.648720 \n```\n\n### The software\n\n[![DOI](https://zenodo.org/badge/DOI/10.5281/zenodo.15274840.svg)](https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.15274840)\n\nReleases of this software are [archived on Zenodo](https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.15274840).\nIf you use ANARCII in your work, please [cite the paper](#the-paper).  If you\nalso want to cite the software specifically, this DOI always resolves to the\nZenodo record for the latest version:\n\n<https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.15274840>\n\nIf you want to cite a specific version, Zenodo provides individual DOIs for\neach, which you can find via the above link to the main record.\n","description_content_type":"text/markdown","docs_url":null,"download_url":null,"downloads":{"last_day":-1,"last_month":-1,"last_week":-1},"dynamic":null,"home_page":null,"keywords":null,"license":null,"license_expression":null,"license_files":["LICENCE"],"maintainer":null,"maintainer_email":null,"name":"anarcii","package_url":"https://pypi.org/project/anarcii/","platform":null,"project_url":"https://pypi.org/project/anarcii/","project_urls":null,"provides_extra":null,"release_url":"https://pypi.org/project/anarcii/2.0.8/","requires_dist":["gemmi","msgpack","numpy","psutil","sortedcontainers","torch"],"requires_python":">=3.11","summary":"A language model suite for numbering antigen receptor sequences.","version":"2.0.8","yanked":false,"yanked_reason":null},"last_serial":38527575,"ownership":{"organization":"opig","roles":[{"role":"Owner","user":"ALGW71"}]},"releases":{"2.0.0":[{"comment_text":null,"core-metadata":{"sha256":"2335d84d2d403d0c371c96909e4f9a7b4478880e34635f36156ecb72b7f80441"},"digests":{"blake2b_256":"48d01a491ad9d7a06a905cd2385c653caace7d79f62873e814c96a182b51c738","md5":"9b072090ff45606099d8ef96bdac7e14","sha256":"d48bba58fe2058f064c7c9e165b819c3c6df331d91966e63d55e25e3ea06b58a"},"downloads":-1,"filename":"anarcii-2.0.0-py2.py3-none-any.whl","has_sig":false,"md5_digest":"9b072090ff45606099d8ef96bdac7e14","packagetype":"bdist_wheel","python_version":"py2.py3","requires_python":null,"size":17570488,"upload_time":"2025-04-24T10:14:01","upload_time_iso_8601":"2025-04-24T10:14:01.819097Z","url":"https://files.pythonhosted.org/packages/48/d0/1a491ad9d7a06a905cd2385c653caace7d79f62873e814c96a182b51c738/anarcii-2.0.0-py2.py3-none-any.whl","yanked":false,"yanked_reason":null},{"comment_text":null,"core-metadata":false,"digests":{"blake2b_256":"93d95992bb702b52ee43e6c96d9c7f902c7ecdfd0b423c6f10424a2348793578","md5":"b91965f4c5ab7